@startuml UC-A5-view-my-name-and-role-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-A5 View my name and role (analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person and Playground as one box. No outside system takes part in the main flow.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-A5.
' Not drawn: the expired proof being renewed (UC-A6), because UC-A5 only points to it.

actor "Person" as P
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB

P -> PG : 1 open my profile\n(who I am is checked, step 3)
alt no valid proof of who the person is
  PG --> P : refused,\nsign in again
else
  PG -> PG : 4 find my account,\nrefresh name and email
  alt the account is deactivated
    PG --> P : 5 refused,\n"Your account\nis deactivated."
  else waiting for approval or active
    PG --> P : 6, 7 my name,\nrole and status
  end
end
@enduml
